  offerLine: I've got something. Doesn't matter what. I'll swap it for a button, a nice shiny one. Now that I've told you, you might even start noticing them out there.
  activeLine: Button. Shiny. Then we'll talk.
  readyLine: Ooh. Yes. Here, take this bit of old paper, it's no good to me. And this lantern. Don't ask whose it was.
  doneLine: Pleasure doing business.
